{"name":"Dew","hex":"#e7f2e9","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Dew","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname.","An unincorporated community in Freestone County, Texas, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Dew"}],"entries":[{"title":"Dew","blocks":[{"text":"Dew is water in the form of droplets that appears on thin, exposed objects in the morning or evening due to condensation. \nAs the exposed surface cools by radiating its heat, atmospheric moisture condenses at a rate greater than that at which it can evaporate, resulting in the formation of water droplets."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/A_drop_of_dew_on_a_clover.jpg/330px-A_drop_of_dew_on_a_clover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dew"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Dew_Formed_on_the_Surface_of_Strawberry_Leafs.jpg/500px-Dew_Formed_on_the_Surface_of_Strawberry_Leafs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Dew_Formed_on_the_Surface_of_Strawberry_Leafs.jpg/1280px-Dew_Formed_on_the_Surface_of_Strawberry_Leafs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Dew_Formed_on_the_Surface_of_Strawberry_Leafs.jpg/500px-Dew_Formed_on_the_Surface_of_Strawberry_Leafs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADew_Formed_on_the_Surface_of_Strawberry_Leafs.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Dew_drop.jpg/500px-Dew_drop.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Dew_drop.jpg/500px-Dew_drop.jpg?